  </diagram>
  <diagram id="6SPM5LwjpcbY__a72idU" name="Page-2">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1426" dy="875" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="9yAyef7SGrgfQQntJmqF-4" connectable="0" parent="1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="428" width="537.58" x="40" y="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9yAyef7SGrgfQQntJmqF-1" parent="9yAyef7SGrgfQQntJmqF-4" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;imageBorder=none;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="428" width="537.58" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9yAyef7SGrgfQQntJmqF-3" parent="9yAyef7SGrgfQQntJmqF-4" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;scraper pipeline&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="97.58" x="10" y="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Zso0LhaVGel4Prl3BPQi-3" parent="9yAyef7SGrgfQQntJmqF-4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="多一個新的stage去做article chunking" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="510" x="13.79" y="192" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QQgPlm1T795HkuNbC-C5-1" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=26;fillColor=#f8cecc;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="&lt;b&gt;Python SDK&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="654" width="480" x="720" y="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="1sTK6BLyDVti_GzO5W1D-2" parent="QQgPlm1T795HkuNbC-C5-1" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;1. configure&lt;/b&gt;(dbname: str, user: str, password: str, embedding_model_api: Optional[str]) -&amp;gt; None:&lt;div&gt;用於設置在pipeline中使用特定功能時會需要的參數。其中dbname, user, password為vector database連線相關情報; embedding_model_api為做embedding時需要呼叫的embedding model，如果沒有設定的話無法使用寫入相關的功能。在內部要實作底下兩個private method。由於只有寫入時需要用到embedding model，因此可以用繼承的方式實作一個base只設定vector database連線，負責寫入的物件繼承後再加上embedding model API的設定，負責查詢的物件繼承後僅實作父類別的方法(super)。&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="480" y="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QQgPlm1T795HkuNbC-C5-2" parent="QQgPlm1T795HkuNbC-C5-1" style="text;strokeColor=#b85450;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=24;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="1a. _configure_database(dbname: str, user: str, password: str) -&amp;gt; DatabaseConfig/None:&lt;br&gt;用於設置一開始與database連線的功能，基本上是你選擇用來操控database的package的一個wrapper (看你是用psycopg2或是sqlalchemy都可以)，讓你可以從這個exposed method的argument中拿到你建立連線必要的資訊就可以。" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="84" width="480" y="156" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="1sTK6BLyDVti_GzO5W1D-3" parent="QQgPlm1T795HkuNbC-C5-1" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=24;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="1b. _configure_embedding_model(str) -&amp;gt; EmbeddingModelConfig/None:&lt;div&gt;用於設置embedding model的端點，可以用來呼叫embedding相關的操作。當缺乏embedding相關的設定時，如果涉及到使用embed相關的功能時(包含在呼叫的父函數如ingest)需要raise exception。&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="84" width="480" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QQgPlm1T795HkuNbC-C5-3" parent="QQgPlm1T795HkuNbC-C5-1" style="text;strokeColor=#b85450;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;2. ingest&lt;/b&gt;(full_text: str, normalization: Optional[Union[str, callable]], metadata: Dict[str, Any]) -&amp;gt; None:&lt;div&gt;用於包裝文章切chunk、做embedding與儲存的wrapper。在其內部應該要實作chunk, embed, commit/save，且這些方法不expose或是可以接受callable來做客製化處理。&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="78" width="480" y="324" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QQgPlm1T795HkuNbC-C5-4" parent="QQgPlm1T795HkuNbC-C5-1" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=24;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;2a. _normalize_full_text(full_text: str, **kwargs) -&amp;gt; str:&lt;div&gt;預設的全文normalization/sanitization邏輯。可以開放這個方法讓使用者可以包裝這個預設的邏輯去做一些客製化。在ingest中normalization為default時使用這個函數去把full_text做normalization/sanitization。keyword argument可以自己選擇要放哪些來決定吃哪些客製化的選項。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="84" width="480" y="402" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0He4ucolHGDnra3Hyi18-1" parent="QQgPlm1T795HkuNbC-C5-1" style="text;strokeColor=#b85450;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;3. query&lt;/b&gt;(prompt: str, metadata: Dict[str, Any]) -&amp;gt; None:&lt;div&gt;被使用於backend service的query，會實作RAG的完整流程: retrieval跟generation。retrieval與generation預設為private method不開放調用(或是部份開放調整的argument)。&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="58" width="480" y="486" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="1sTK6BLyDVti_GzO5W1D-1" parent="QQgPlm1T795HkuNbC-C5-1" style="text;strokeColor=#b85450;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Note&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;※與database操作相關的連線管理(pool/rollback)等功能如果沒有需求的話不需要expose方法出來，特別是rollback等應該實作在實際的操作中(try-except block)，而不是expose rollback出來讓user自己決定如何rollback。&lt;div&gt;※由於涉及到DB的寫入與query，因此可能在configure/ingest/query中都要實作一段table確認的邏輯。(configure中甚至會需要在identify到沒有指定table/table&amp;amp;column的時候)去CREATE IF NOT EXIST。&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="480" y="544" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="99x7pbSQJ6pHdSLiZ7x2-1" edge="1" parent="1" source="1sTK6BLyDVti_GzO5W1D-2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="9yAyef7SGrgfQQntJmqF-1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="99x7pbSQJ6pHdSLiZ7x2-2" edge="1" parent="1" source="QQgPlm1T795HkuNbC-C5-3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="9yAyef7SGrgfQQntJmqF-1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="649" y="383" />
              <mxPoint x="649" y="534" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kT2ALi5k8JFXh0xnaU6a-3" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=26;fillColor=#d5e8d4;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;Backend mircoservice&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="78" width="320" x="1320.5" y="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Zso0LhaVGel4Prl3BPQi-1" parent="kT2ALi5k8JFXh0xnaU6a-3" style="text;strokeColor=#82b366;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="configure(dbname: str, user: str, password: str):" vertex="1">
